# Synapse AI — Frontend Environment Variables

# API Base URL:
# - Leave EMPTY for local development (uses Vite dev proxy to http://127.0.0.1:8000)
# - Leave EMPTY if using Vercel / Nginx rewrites (requests remain relative /api/*)
# - Set to your live backend domain if making direct cross-origin API calls:
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://api.yourdomain.com
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://synapse-backend.up.railway.app
VITE_API_BASE_URL=
